WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.546
Division undoes multiplication: if 7 times 8 equals 56, then 56 divided by 7 equals 8

00:00:07.546 --> 00:00:10.760
and 56 divided by 8 equals 7.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:17.099
Calculate 16 divided by 4. The answer is 4. 4 times 4 equals 16.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:23.660
A club at a science exhibition shares 21 pencils equally among 7 teams. How many per

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.801
team? Pause the video and think.

00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:32.734
A club at a science exhibition shares 21 pencils equally among 7 teams. How many per

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:36.558
team? The answer is 3. 7 times 3 equals 21.
